WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:05.797
As for the dream-filled Tomorrow,

00:05.906 --> 00:11.344
No one can see it...

00:13.180 --> 00:18.812
I close my eyes and think of you,

00:19.320 --> 00:25.054
Who I'll meet someday...

00:25.559 --> 00:31.794
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:32.166 --> 00:38.298
Show the spring to these eyes of mine.

00:38.739 --> 00:44.939
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:45.279 --> 00:51.149
Farewell to the city in winter.

00:51.785 --> 00:58.156
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:58.359 --> 01:04.457
Call the spring to my heart.

01:04.999 --> 01:11.131
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

01:11.505 --> 01:18.069
Farewell, snow flakes.

02:03.223 --> 02:05.384
Shibuya Station

02:27.548 --> 02:32.619
In this city, the sun is broken.
The sky is small.

02:32.619 --> 02:34.521
And there are no mountains.

02:34.521 --> 02:37.424
All I can see are
grey buildings...

02:37.424 --> 02:38.948
and waves of people...

03:22.503 --> 03:23.367
Ow!

03:23.604 --> 03:25.094
Ouch, ouch!

03:25.472 --> 03:26.871
Are you ok?

03:28.342 --> 03:29.468
Are you hurt?

03:33.914 --> 03:35.939
You want to cross
the street, right?

03:37.584 --> 03:38.719
Then, here...

03:38.719 --> 03:40.880
Uh... Excuse me...

03:49.396 --> 03:50.727
Look out!

03:54.601 --> 03:57.593
- Whoa!
- What's happening?

03:58.038 --> 04:02.304
- What in the world?
- Look at those cars!

04:08.549 --> 04:10.881
Gently... Gently...

04:22.829 --> 04:25.499
I didn't know that cars
could fly so high...

04:25.499 --> 04:28.235
Did you do that?
Are you a mage?

04:28.235 --> 04:30.771
I'm just a trainee, though.

04:30.771 --> 04:34.263
Wow. This is my
first time to see a mage...

04:41.381 --> 04:41.972
Huh?

04:43.050 --> 04:46.918
Then... why don't you
cross the street by your Power?

04:47.721 --> 04:52.488
Sunset and Steel Frames (Part 1)

04:54.328 --> 04:55.329
Attention, passengers: This train will be
departing shortly. Please confirm your...

04:55.329 --> 04:56.930
Attention, passengers: This train will be
departing shortly. Please confirm your...
Shimo-Kitazawa is about
5 minutes from here.

04:56.930 --> 04:58.398
destination at this time. If you're
transferring to another line, platform...
Shimo-Kitazawa is about
5 minutes from here.

04:58.398 --> 05:01.468
destination at this time. If you're
transferring to another line, platform...
Thank you for bringing me
all the way to the platform.

05:01.468 --> 05:02.736
directories are located throughout the
station for your convenience. Next stop...
I have a monthly pass, so...

05:02.736 --> 05:04.004
directories are located throughout the
station for your convenience. Next stop...
Um... A token of thanks...

05:04.004 --> 05:05.872
At Platform 2, the doors are closing.
Please step away from the tracks.
I don't want a
token of thanks.

05:05.872 --> 05:06.964
At Platform 2, the doors are closing.
Please step away from the tracks.
But...

05:07.541 --> 05:10.032
Good luck with
your mage training.

05:10.577 --> 05:11.345
At Platform Number 2 the doors
are closing. Please step back.
Uh...

05:11.345 --> 05:14.837
At Platform Number 2 the doors
are closing. Please step back.

05:17.618 --> 05:19.051
Platform #2, for Shimo-Kitazawa...

05:19.319 --> 05:21.588
Um... Let me pay you
back with my Power.

05:21.588 --> 05:22.850
I said I don't need anything.

05:32.633 --> 05:35.932
Whoa! Ugh!
What's this? What's this!

05:45.946 --> 05:47.709
General Bureau of Mage Labor,
Mage Trainee Handbook
Pajamas, Alarm Clock, Towels,
Bath Towel, Apron, Toothbrush

05:50.317 --> 05:55.422
Arrive at the place designated by
the instructor without using your Power.

05:55.422 --> 05:59.381
This task is the
beginning of your training.

06:02.729 --> 06:05.095
I already used my Power...

06:06.667 --> 06:07.634
Huh?

06:08.201 --> 06:10.101
Oof. Oof!

06:10.170 --> 06:15.802
Shimo-Kitazawa Station

06:17.711 --> 06:19.746
Excuse me.
Gum, please.

06:19.746 --> 06:21.543
That's 120 yen.

06:22.115 --> 06:25.419
Um, which way is
Daizawa 5-chome?

06:25.419 --> 06:27.250
Straight ahead on that street.

06:27.954 --> 06:29.717
Thank you very much.

06:35.228 --> 06:35.729
Shimo-Kitazawa Shopping Street
- Thank you for shopping at...

06:35.729 --> 06:37.264
Shimo-Kitazawa Shopping Street
- Thank you for shopping at...
- That street?

06:37.264 --> 06:42.566
We are open from 9 AM to
8 PM for your shopping convenience...

07:00.020 --> 07:03.080
Daizawa Minami 5-chome.
I'm almost there.

07:24.578 --> 07:25.875
Here?

07:36.990 --> 07:38.091
- We're not open yet.

07:38.091 --> 07:40.423
- We're not open yet.
- Uh! Um... Well...

07:40.994 --> 07:43.563
Like I said,
we're not open yet.

07:43.563 --> 07:45.497
Um... No, well...

07:46.266 --> 07:49.633
I just unlocked the door.
We open at 8 o'clock at night.

07:49.903 --> 07:53.066
Is there someone here
named "Oyamada-san"?

07:54.174 --> 07:55.976
You want to see
the owner of this bar?

07:55.976 --> 07:58.672
Yes. I'd like to see
Oyamada Masami-san.

08:00.013 --> 08:02.880
Are you a mage?
A trainee?

08:02.949 --> 08:04.184
- Yes, I am.

08:04.184 --> 08:05.151
- Yes, I am.
- Really?

08:06.887 --> 08:07.979
Really.

08:08.221 --> 08:12.157
You look more like an
applicant in serious trouble.

08:15.862 --> 08:17.431
I'm sorry to bother you.

08:17.431 --> 08:19.023
Well, I'm "Kera".

08:19.232 --> 08:22.633
Kera-san?
That's an unusual family name.

08:23.170 --> 08:25.038
My family name is Katoh.

08:25.038 --> 08:26.673
Then, Katoh Kera-san?

08:26.673 --> 08:28.141
My first name's "Go".

08:28.141 --> 08:29.335
Katoh Go?

08:30.210 --> 08:32.303
Kera's my nickname.
What about you?

08:32.512 --> 08:34.639
Yume. It's Kikuchi Yume.

08:35.215 --> 08:36.580
Nice to meet-cha!

08:36.883 --> 08:39.545
Nice to meet you, also.

08:40.120 --> 08:43.089
Federal Bureau of Mage Labor,
Tokyo District Certified
Oyamada Mage Labor Office
Certificate #000186

08:43.089 --> 08:44.691
Federal Bureau of Mage Labor,
Tokyo District Certified
Oyamada Mage Labor Office
Certificate #000186
Owner, coming in.

08:44.691 --> 08:46.022
Federal Bureau of Mage Labor,
Tokyo District Certified
Oyamada Mage Labor Office
Certificate #000186

08:46.960 --> 08:48.484
Huh? He's not here.

08:49.229 --> 08:50.630
- Then, I wonder if he's home.

08:50.630 --> 08:51.028
- Then, I wonder if he's home.
- Oh?

09:00.307 --> 09:01.575
- Thanks for your hard work.

09:01.575 --> 09:02.337
- Thanks for your hard work.
- Ah, Owner!

09:04.411 --> 09:05.309
Owner?

09:06.546 --> 09:08.446
Oyamada-san?

09:09.082 --> 09:10.276
Yes...

09:10.484 --> 09:13.180
Oyamada Masami-sensei?

09:13.653 --> 09:16.356
Yes, I am.
Who are you?

09:16.356 --> 09:18.847
I can't believe it!
You're not a female teacher?

09:19.726 --> 09:21.318
Female?

09:22.429 --> 09:25.091
Because of my name,
I'm often mistaken for a female.

09:25.332 --> 09:25.999
- Ugh...

09:25.999 --> 09:27.091
- Ugh...
- Watch out!

09:28.502 --> 09:29.903
Hey, are you all right?

09:29.903 --> 09:30.733
What's wrong?

09:33.373 --> 09:34.774
- What are you doing?

09:34.774 --> 09:36.376
- What are you doing?
- Are you all right?

09:36.376 --> 09:38.037
Uh... Um...

09:38.612 --> 09:41.547
Clothes. Please
put some clothes on!

09:42.148 --> 09:43.240
Huh?

09:43.650 --> 09:44.639
Oops!

09:45.519 --> 09:47.687
Owner, your nipples are exposed!

09:47.687 --> 09:48.551
Yours, too, Kera.

09:50.423 --> 09:52.025
A guidebook?

09:52.025 --> 09:56.018
Yes. The guidebook that the
Bureau of Mage Labor sent you.

09:59.900 --> 10:01.162
Do you like gum?

10:01.535 --> 10:06.632
No. Well, I thought I should buy something
when asking for directions at train stations.

10:06.806 --> 10:08.275
So you asked four times?

10:08.275 --> 10:09.264
Yes...

10:14.347 --> 10:15.279
Hmm?

10:16.216 --> 10:19.276
Nothing...
I just thought it was beautiful.

10:20.153 --> 10:22.556
When you register at the
Bureau of Mage Labor tomorrow,

10:22.556 --> 10:24.524
they'll give you one, too.

10:24.524 --> 10:27.459
Uh... Um... yes.

10:35.335 --> 10:39.506
How do you do, Kikuchi Yume-san,
from Tono City, Iwate Prefecture.

10:39.506 --> 10:43.306
Welcome. I am Oyamada Masami,
a mage training instructor.

10:43.743 --> 10:45.478
How do you do?

10:45.478 --> 10:47.280
I'm sorry about earlier.

10:47.280 --> 10:48.582
Not at all.

10:48.582 --> 10:52.245
Kikuchi-san, you're the daughter
of Kikuchi Etsuko-san, right?

10:52.485 --> 10:54.453
You know my mother?

10:55.055 --> 10:58.858
I've heard that your mother
is a very distinguished mage.

10:58.858 --> 11:03.563
Well, I'm flattered. But she
does not use her Power anymore.

11:03.563 --> 11:05.398
Is that so?

11:05.398 --> 11:07.133
- Uh, please have some juice.

11:07.133 --> 11:07.497
- Uh, please have some juice.
- Yes.

11:10.403 --> 11:16.273
The daughter of that legendary mage...
I wonder why she was assigned to me.

11:19.779 --> 11:23.550
Tomorrow we go to the Bureau of
Mage Labor for temporary registration.

11:23.550 --> 11:26.386
What you'll do for the
training is assist me.

11:26.386 --> 11:28.788
Once you settle in, you'll
take mage actions on your own.

11:28.788 --> 11:31.458
Finally, you'll take
a certification test.

11:31.458 --> 11:32.288
Yes.

11:32.759 --> 11:36.563
The training starts tomorrow.
You must be tired today.

11:36.563 --> 11:39.225
You may go to
your boardinghouse.

11:39.933 --> 11:42.163
Could you tell me
your cell phone number?

11:42.669 --> 11:45.972
I don't have one.
Our house is "out of area."

11:45.972 --> 11:49.643
Then please tell me the phone
number of your boarding house.

11:49.643 --> 11:53.546
The application said the teacher's
house is available for boarding,

11:53.546 --> 11:57.539
and I thought my
teacher was female, so...

11:58.084 --> 12:02.248
Oh, I see. So my house is the
boardinghouse. I missed that.

12:03.023 --> 12:04.786
What shall I do?

12:05.358 --> 12:06.459
- That's fine.

12:06.459 --> 12:07.527
- That's fine.
- What?

12:07.527 --> 12:09.222
Boarding is available here.

12:09.496 --> 12:11.364
There's a room upstairs.

12:11.364 --> 12:13.093
Other trainees have
stayed there, too.

12:13.800 --> 12:17.170
But, isn't it imposing
on your family?

12:17.170 --> 12:19.001
I live alone.

12:24.344 --> 12:25.470
This is the room.

12:25.645 --> 12:27.772
Whoa! How cute!

12:28.214 --> 12:30.850
Yes. This room is very popular.

12:30.850 --> 12:34.843
I have to go and
get the bar ready.

12:34.954 --> 12:37.650
Please help yourself to
anything you need in the house.

12:38.324 --> 12:40.315
Oh, Sensei, please wait.

12:41.494 --> 12:43.263
Here is an unworthy gift.

12:43.263 --> 12:45.094
Oh, how polite of you...

12:45.532 --> 12:49.436
Thank you in advance for all
you'll do for me in the next month.

12:49.436 --> 12:50.232
No, thank you.

12:58.712 --> 13:00.771
Thank you for your care.

13:07.787 --> 13:11.780
Hey, is that you, Mama?
It's me, Yume.

13:11.991 --> 13:13.322
I got here.

13:13.593 --> 13:15.356
Yeah, I'm fine!

13:15.929 --> 13:17.931
The training starts tomorrow.

13:17.931 --> 13:19.899
I've already met
with my teacher.

13:20.934 --> 13:22.799
I said I'll be fine.

13:24.304 --> 13:25.293
Bye-bye.

13:36.249 --> 13:39.707
I'm not a little kid anymore.
I'll be fine.

13:39.853 --> 13:44.790
"Here is the fee for my call.
Yume"

14:16.422 --> 14:19.186
Did I come to
Oyamada-sensei's house?

14:43.917 --> 14:45.384
Huh? Kikuchi-san!

14:45.585 --> 14:50.690
Hey, Yume! You're a minor.
You can't come to places like this.

14:50.690 --> 14:51.591
What?

14:51.591 --> 14:53.326
What I said was...

14:53.326 --> 14:55.461
Are those drinks tasty?

14:55.461 --> 14:57.130
What are you talking about?

14:57.130 --> 14:59.132
You can stay
only if you dance.

14:59.132 --> 15:00.133
Dance?

15:00.133 --> 15:02.802
Of course. Why do you think
we have this big open floor?

15:02.802 --> 15:04.235
We dance Salsa here!

15:21.221 --> 15:22.745
I smell sweaty.

15:34.901 --> 15:36.061
Excuse me!

15:46.012 --> 15:47.480
May I ask who it is?

15:47.480 --> 15:49.415
It's Do-Re-Mi Pizza!

15:49.415 --> 15:50.984
I didn't order anything.

15:50.984 --> 15:53.248
This is Mr. Oyamada's
residence, right?

15:53.853 --> 15:55.718
It's already paid for.

15:56.055 --> 15:59.149
I see. Mr. Oyamada must
have ordered it for me.

16:20.713 --> 16:22.215
It got cold.

16:22.215 --> 16:24.384
Big Sis Aya bought it for us!

16:24.384 --> 16:25.752
That's right.
It smells so good.

16:25.752 --> 16:27.020
I hear we're supposed
to eat it with our hands!

16:27.020 --> 16:28.721
Now, try to pull it
apart from that side.

16:28.721 --> 16:31.024
Dad, don't tear off
from a weird place!

16:31.024 --> 16:32.191
- Haru, give me a plate.

16:32.191 --> 16:33.960
- Haru, give me a plate.
- Let's drink the "sparkling" stuff.

16:33.960 --> 16:36.462
Ah, Grandma!
You don't cut a pizza in squares!

16:36.462 --> 16:37.864
Give me some chopsticks!

16:37.864 --> 16:40.199
Eat pizza with chopsticks?
That'll surprise the Italians!

16:40.199 --> 16:41.634
Not too bad...

16:41.634 --> 16:43.261
It's delicious!

17:01.621 --> 17:05.057
Hang in there,
Kikuchi Yume...

17:26.846 --> 17:29.076
Ahh! Kera-san!

17:29.782 --> 17:30.908
Hey, Yume.

17:31.217 --> 17:34.277
Good morning.
You're quite the early riser.

17:34.520 --> 17:36.255
I just got off work.

17:36.255 --> 17:38.358
You mean...
From last night?

17:38.358 --> 17:41.657
That's right. I'll have
breakfast, go home and go to bed.

17:41.928 --> 17:43.262
Good night!

17:43.262 --> 17:45.093
Uh... Good night.

17:50.503 --> 17:52.130
Good morning!

17:52.505 --> 17:54.063
Good morning,
Kikuchi-san.

17:54.474 --> 17:56.476
My name...
"Yume" is fine.

17:56.476 --> 18:00.413
All right then, Yume-chan.
Did you sleep well?

18:00.413 --> 18:05.578
Yes. Um, were you working
until just now, too, Sensei?

18:06.786 --> 18:10.056
No. I finished a little early.
Is Cafe au Lait all right?

18:10.056 --> 18:12.081
Uh, yes. I'll help.

18:14.894 --> 18:16.987
Whoa, what a fancy breakfast!

18:17.463 --> 18:20.900
I want to eat breakfast
like this at home,

18:20.900 --> 18:23.770
but Mama- I mean my mother-

18:23.770 --> 18:26.806
says that it's just a
snack, and not a real meal.

18:26.806 --> 18:27.966
Well, please enjoy.

18:28.941 --> 18:29.965
And so I will.

18:31.177 --> 18:32.508
For dinner tonight...

18:32.712 --> 18:33.576
Yes?

18:34.113 --> 18:35.114
Is pizza ok with you?

18:35.114 --> 18:38.675
Uh... I left a lot of it
untouched last night.

18:38.918 --> 18:40.909
Let's reheat it
and eat together.

18:41.587 --> 18:42.918
Together?

18:43.089 --> 18:45.421
Tonight I'll be home.

18:45.792 --> 18:46.724
Yes.

18:48.995 --> 18:51.264
Today, before going to the
Bureau of Mage Labor,

18:51.264 --> 18:52.595
I'd like to go to
our branch office.

18:52.765 --> 18:54.460
Our branch office?

18:54.667 --> 18:56.836
Right. It's a branch office
of the Bureau of Mage Labor

18:56.836 --> 19:00.106
in the ward office. That's where
requests for mage actions are accepted.

19:00.106 --> 19:03.542
A branch office of the
Bureau of Mage Labor?

19:04.811 --> 19:06.412
That's where the
"person in charge" of your case is.

19:06.412 --> 19:07.970
He'll take good care of you.

19:09.048 --> 19:09.749
Number 418, please come
to Window 27.

19:09.749 --> 19:14.954
"Information Desk"
Number 418, please come
to Window 27.

19:14.954 --> 19:15.855
Standard of Living Section
Cultural Exchange Section
Youth and Children Section
Public Relations Section
Number 418, please come
to Window 27.

19:15.855 --> 19:16.789
Standard of Living Section
Cultural Exchange Section
Youth and Children Section
Public Relations Section
Number 418, please come
to Window 27.

19:16.789 --> 19:17.723
Standard of Living Section
Cultural Exchange Section
Youth and Children Section
Public Relations Section

19:17.723 --> 19:18.624
Bureau of Mage Labor
Branch Office

19:18.624 --> 19:19.386
Bureau of Mage Labor
Branch Office

19:21.694 --> 19:22.922
Excuse me.

19:23.096 --> 19:25.758
Oyamada-san!
Good to see you!

19:26.232 --> 19:28.034
Is Chief Endo available?

19:28.034 --> 19:28.835
Ticket number 539,
please proceed to Window #28.

19:28.835 --> 19:30.903
Ticket number 539,
please proceed to Window #28.
Huh? He was here
just a little while ago.

19:30.903 --> 19:34.574
Ticket number 539,
please proceed to Window #28.
I'm sorry. He seems to have
stepped out for the moment.

19:34.574 --> 19:36.008
Ticket number 539,
please proceed to Window #28.
Is he out on business?

19:36.008 --> 19:37.305
No. He must have
gone to the restroom.

19:38.945 --> 19:40.746
Please wait over there.

19:40.746 --> 19:41.914
Uh... uh?

19:41.914 --> 19:43.182
- Thank you, Sachiko-san.

19:43.182 --> 19:44.317
- Thank you, Sachiko-san.
- Sure.

19:44.317 --> 19:45.151
Who, me?

19:45.151 --> 19:46.752
You've gotten better
at using honorifics.

19:46.752 --> 19:49.653
Come on!
You're making me so happy!

19:49.822 --> 19:52.925
What was it?
Something "take you on"?

19:52.925 --> 19:54.127
"I can take you on!"

19:54.127 --> 19:58.131
Right, right! No one would believe
that you used to say such a thing!

19:58.131 --> 20:03.364
I'm so happy. I'll put some ice in
your barley tea! Please have a seat.

20:12.345 --> 20:13.546
Excuse me?

20:13.546 --> 20:16.349
About Oyamada-kun...
What did he bring?

20:16.349 --> 20:20.019
What? Some kind of
paperwork for his previous trainee.

20:20.019 --> 20:23.356
Ugh! The letter of explanation
and apology is way past due.

20:23.356 --> 20:26.359
I'm the one who gets
chewed out by the main office.

20:26.359 --> 20:27.587
I'm so sorry.

20:27.660 --> 20:28.456
Who are you?

20:28.794 --> 20:31.422
I've come for the mage
training. I'm Kikuchi.

20:31.597 --> 20:36.169
Ah, yes. Yes. Do your best
to become a good mage.

20:36.169 --> 20:37.101
Yes...

20:37.170 --> 20:38.000
Huh?

20:43.042 --> 20:45.943
Give this back to the apprentice
in Shimo-Kitazawa!

20:47.046 --> 20:48.843
Um... Yesterday...

20:49.615 --> 20:50.707
Thank you...

20:51.083 --> 20:51.913
You!

20:51.951 --> 20:54.852
...very much.

20:55.021 --> 20:57.590
What's up with using Power
as a token of thanks?

20:57.590 --> 21:00.855
I wasn't kind to you because
I wanted something like this!

21:06.866 --> 21:09.630
Don't pity me,
you mage!

21:20.213 --> 21:26.880
When I turn around, it's still there,

21:29.789 --> 21:36.490
The future I've been pursuing.

21:38.064 --> 21:47.097
I have something precious in my heart.

21:47.306 --> 21:51.902
Upon the still unseen blue and

21:52.878 --> 21:59.807
The floating clouds, I wished...

22:02.588 --> 22:04.824
Under the Blue Sky

22:04.824 --> 22:11.889
From that dream that we dreamed that day,

22:11.998 --> 22:18.562
Let's not wake up, and let's not stop...

22:21.540 --> 22:23.709
Under the Blue Sky

22:23.709 --> 22:30.774
Let's keep shining and moving on.

22:30.950 --> 22:37.150
The endless journey continues...

22:49.802 --> 22:51.736
PREVIEW

22:52.838 --> 22:55.136
The streets and skyscrapers
are tinged with red.

22:55.207 --> 22:57.043
The shadows stretch
long and dark.

22:57.043 --> 23:02.048
